<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (RevvWash addresses the challenge of limited access, long queues, and time inefficiencies associated with traditional car wash services. With increasing urban mobility demands and busy lifestyles, there is a growing need for flexible, location-independent vehicle care solutions that bring services directly to the customer.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
