/P 136 0 R
/E (The system is built as a mobile-first digital platform supported by GPS-enabled mobile service units. It integrates booking, geolocation, distance-based pricing, and digital payments, enabling real-time service matching between customers and mobile car wash vans.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [8]
>>
