/E (SENTRY Hub is a protective digital platform designed to safeguard vulnerable members of society from cyber crimes with a strong focus on scam prevention. The project provides awareness, reporting and early-warning mechanisms to help users identify, avoid and respond to scams occurring both online and offline including phone-based and face-to-face interactions. By combining education, community reporting and alert systems, SENTRY Hub empowers users to stay informed, act quickly and reduce the risk of financial, emotional and digital exploitation.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
