/E (The Research and Innovation Club participated in an SDG-aligned forum hosted by I Choose Life Africa, exploring inclusive and climate-resilient development in Kenya and Africa. Drawing from sustainability, entrepreneurship, and systems dialogue, the event highlighted clean energy, resilient infrastructure, circular economy solutions, and dignity-centered livelihoods. Emphasis was placed on innovation, community asset ownership, and partnerships that translate research into scalable impact.)
